{"version":1,"content":"<p>中鐵建交通運營集團有限公司副總經理、總會計師王青的碩士學位論文被指抄襲，西南交通大學今天（4日）證實事件，決定撤銷王青的碩士學位。</p><p>中鐵建交通運營集團尚未就事件作出回應。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:26:37.144107+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T14:59:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T17:58:30.405637+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:05.766231+00:00","content_hash":"a5978b71a5cbe9b584b6c15196147d4f3bec7ac3da47f1dbeaa471745c5e8deb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}